Assistant: Let's enhance our mock InsightsProvider to better match what the component expects. We'll create a more complete mock that includes methods and state that the PopularEventsTable might need.

<file path="apps/web/.temp/dessn-component-routes/PopularEventsTable-b8ed6223.tsx">
